as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="740" y="1710"/><mxPoint x="1150" y="1710"/><mxPoint x="1150" y="465"/></Array><mxPoint x="-20" y="4" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e93" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=9;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="lane_frontend" source="fe_falha" target="fe_merge_fim"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="190" y="1842"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e94" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=9;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="lane_frontend" source="fe_desafio_cumprido" target="fe_merge_fim"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e95" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=9;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="lane_frontend" source="fe_merge_fim" target="fe_resultado_final"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e96" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=9;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="lane_frontend" source="fe_resultado_final" target="fe_fork_resultado"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e97" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=9;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="lane_frontend" source="fe_fork_resultado" target="fe_merge_aguardar"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="16" y="1986"/><mxPoint x="16" y="620"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e98" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=9;strokeWidth=1.3;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="fe_fork_resultado" target="obj_resultado_final"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1440" y="2110"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n99" value="&lt;b&gt;Diagrama de Atividades (UML): raias do Operador e do Frontend&lt;/b&gt; (tarefa 2.3, issue #248) · versão de 25/09/2026, aprovada pela equipe e alinhada à HU-FE-13; a integração com as demais raias cabe à Gerência de Software" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="20" width="2150" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="reserva_firmware_backend" value="Espaço reservado para as raias de &lt;b&gt;Firmware&lt;/b&gt; e &lt;b&gt;Backend&lt;/b&gt;, a cargo de outros integrantes. Os marcadores &lt;b&gt;F&lt;/b&gt; (verde) e &lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt; (roxo) indicam onde as raias se encontram." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#9a9a9a;fontColor=#6b6b6b;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="80" width="270" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legenda" value='&lt;div style="text-align:left;padding:8px;"&gt;&lt;b style="font-size:15px;"&gt;Legenda dos marcadores&lt;/b&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px;margin-top:6px;"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;background:#eeeeee;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;"&gt;Marcador&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;background:#eeeeee;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;"&gt;Direção&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;background:#eeeeee;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;"&gt;Raia&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;background:#eeeeee;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;"&gt;Atividade esperada na outra raia&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;background:#eeeeee;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;"&gt;Objeto trocado&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;background:#eeeeee;text-align:left;font-weight:bold;"&gt;Requisitos&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;background:#d5e8d4;font-weight:bold;"&gt;F1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;saída&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Firmware&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Inicialização: auto-teste, reendereçamento dos ToF, leitura do DIP, montagem do mapa e Wi-Fi STA&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Robô energizado com o DIP configurado&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;RF-27 a RF-31, RF-51, RNF-35&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;background:#d5e8d4;font-weight:bold;"&gt;F2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;entrada&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Firmware&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Sinalizar prontidão (estado Aguardando) ou erro&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Sinalização de prontidão ou de erro&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;RF-32, RF-55&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;background:#d5e8d4;font-weight:bold;"&gt;F3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;saída&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Firmware&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Iniciar a Sessão de Resolução (Aguardando → Mapeando)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Sinal de início da tentativa&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;RF-5, RF-54&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;background:#e1d5e7;font-weight:bold;"&gt;B1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;saída&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Backend&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Registrar o painel (somente leitura) no canal de corridas ao vivo&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Pedido de inscrição no canal de corridas ao vivo&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;RF-88, RNF-55&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;background:#e1d5e7;font-weight:bold;"&gt;B2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;entrada&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Backend&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Criar a corrida e avisar o canal de corridas ao vivo (também ao painel que se reconecta)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Aviso de corrida ao vivo&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;RF-78, RF-88&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;background:#e1d5e7;font-weight:bold;"&gt;B3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;saída&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Backend&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Registrar a inscrição do painel na corrida&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Pedido de inscrição na corrida&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;RF-88&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;background:#e1d5e7;font-weight:bold;"&gt;B4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;entrada&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Backend&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Enviar o snapshot consistente da corrida&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Snapshot da corrida&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;RF-89&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;background:#e1d5e7;font-weight:bold;"&gt;B5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;entrada&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Backend&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Distribuir atualizações aos painéis inscritos: métricas derivadas, status com motivo de término (inclusive estouro do tempo limite) e avisos de sinal do robô&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;Atualização da corrida&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;vertical-align:top;"&gt;RF-82 a RF-85, RF-87, RF-88, RF-90, RF-92&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Convenções&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• O fluxo de controle de cada raia permanece nela; a comunicação com outras raias aparece como fluxo de objeto (insumo ou saída) que começa ou termina em um marcador. Na integração, cada marcador é substituído por um fluxo ligado à atividade indicada acima.&lt;br&gt;• A ação que recebe um objeto só começa quando o objeto chega (ex.: “Aguardar o aviso de corrida ao vivo” espera B2).&lt;br&gt;• A atividade final (◉), na raia do Operador, encerra todos os fluxos, inclusive o painel que voltou a aguardar nova corrida.&lt;br&gt;• Nova tentativa = desligar e religar o robô (nova inicialização completa, RF-19, RF-56, RF-81): confirmar com a raia de Firmware.&lt;br&gt;• Referências em cinza sob cada ação: requisitos atendidos (2 - Requisitos.md).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;overflow=fill;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2220" y="120" width="780" height="470" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>